{
	"_meta": {
		"purpose": "Per-block fixtures for the offline setting check (instances.py): the attributes, variants, partner preconditions, children, parents and paint states each block renders with, plus `harness` (the render harness options: stubWoocommerce, renderFile, postFile, attachmentsFile; paths relative to this folder) and `post` (steps the renderer applies to the rendered markup, standing in for a view script). Seeded from scripts/computed-route/calibration-fixtures.json, with every part switched on (see each block's `notes`)."
	},
